WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:03.767
Release notes eat an afternoon.

2
00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:06.500
Meet Shipnote.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.667
It groups your commits and drafts the
changelog.

4
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.700
Commits are grouped by their conventional
type.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.233
Run the draft command in your repo.

6
00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:21.733
One command writes the changelog.

7
00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:22.367
Shipnote.

8
00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.633
Release notes from your commits.
